    <bpmn:process id="W_W3521" name="W3521. Packaging Strategy, Standards &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual SCM/sustainability planning (links to VS-33.1/VS-25); EPR/regulatory change (links to VS-22)
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Group packaging/pallet estate
Owner: Packaging Engineering / SCM
Participants: Packaging Eng, SCM/Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Merchandising (links to VS-01/VS-41), Logistics (links to VS-06), Sustainability (links to VS-25), Quality (links to VS-31), Finance (links to VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W3521 — Packaging Strategy, Standards &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3521_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3521_Lane1" name="Packaging Eng">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3521_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3521_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3521_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3521_Lane2" name="SCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3521_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3521_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3521_Start4" name="Annual SCM/sustainability planning (links to VS-33.1/VS-25); EPR/regulatory change (links…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3521_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3521_Task5" name="Packaging Eng/SCM set the packaging strategy and standards: packaging policy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/SCM set the packaging strategy and standards: packaging policy, standard materials and specs, modular/standardized carton and pallet sizes (to optimize cube links to VS-110/W3541), right-sizing and over-packaging elimination, private-label packaging standards (links to VS-41), and brand/graphics requirements (links to VS-14); align to sustainability (links to VS-25) and EPR obligations (W3526)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / SCM
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3521_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3521_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3521_Task6" name="Packaging Eng/Merchandising define the packaging governance: who…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Packaging Eng/Merchandising define the packaging governance: who specifies/approves packaging (vendor vs BuildRight for private label), change-control, packaging-BOM in the item master (links to VS-29), and performance metrics (damage, cost, sustainability); set the pallet/RTI strategy (W3529)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Merchandising
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3521_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3521_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3521_Task7" name="SCM/Finance approve the packaging cost-reduction and sustainability targets…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: SCM/Finance approve the packaging cost-reduction and sustainability targets (links to W3542/W3526), align to the budget (links to VS-33.1) and commodity outlook (links to VS-106 — corrugate/plastic are commodity-derived), and report to governance (W3544)
Responsible (R): SCM / Finance
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3521_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3521_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3521_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3521_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-79 (ensure RTI &amp; pallet asset reconciliation.) | - operational: standards and modular sizes; operational: governance and audit (W3539)
Owner: Packaging Engineering / SCM</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3521_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3521_Annotation9" targetRef="W3521_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3521_Flow11" sourceRef="W3521_Start4" targetRef="W3521_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3521_Flow12" sourceRef="W3521_Task5" targetRef="W3521_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3521_Flow13" sourceRef="W3521_Task6" targetRef="W3521_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3521_Flow14" sourceRef="W3521_Task7" targetRef="W3521_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
