    <bpmn:process id="W_W3524" name="W3524. Packaging Material Procurement &amp; Supplier Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Packaging spec (W3522/W3523); replenishment need
Frequency: Continuous + annual contracts
Volume: Cartons, stretch wrap, dunnage, labels, tape, etc.
Owner: Procurement (Category)
Participants: Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Packaging Eng, SCM, Finance (links to VS-15/VS-17), DC (links to VS-04), Supplier
Source: workflow W3524 — Packaging Material Procurement &amp; Supplier Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3524_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3524_Lane1" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3524_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3524_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3524_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3524_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3524_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3524_Start3" name="Packaging spec (W3522/W3523); replenishment need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3524_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3524_Task4" name="Procurement/Packaging Eng source packaging materials per spec…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procurement/Packaging Eng source packaging materials per spec: cartons/corrugate, stretch-wrap, strapping, labels, tape, void-fill, desiccant, and specialty materials; RFQ/framework agreements (links to VS-03/VS-34 methodology), supplier qualification, and total-cost evaluation (material, lead time, sustainability)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Packaging Eng
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Annual + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3524_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3524_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3524_Task5" name="Procurement/Supplier manage supply: forecast packaging-material demand (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement/Supplier manage supply: forecast packaging-material demand (links to VS-02), place orders/blanket releases (links to VS-03.2), manage lead times and import for specialty materials (links to VS-02.2/VS-87), and ensure quality (links to VS-31); manage price volatility (corrugate/plastic links to VS-106)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Supplier / SCM
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3524_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3524_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3524_Task6" name="Procurement/Finance manage packaging-material AP (links to VS-15), allocate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement/Finance manage packaging-material AP (links to VS-15), allocate cost to the packaging-BOM/cost object (links to W3528/W3514), track supplier performance (links to VS-67), and feed cost analytics (W3542) and reduction initiatives (W3518); manage packaging-material inventory (links to VS-05)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Finance / DC
Accountable (A): SCM Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3524_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3524_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3524_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
