Volume: ~800–1,000 vendors + private-label pipeline
Owner: Packaging Engineer / Quality
Participants: Packaging Eng, Quality (links to VS-31), Vendor Management (links to VS-03), Private Label (links to VS-41), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Import (links to VS-02.2/VS-87)
Source: workflow W3525 — Private-Label &amp; Vendor Packaging Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
