        <bpmn:outgoing>W3525_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3525_Task5" name="Packaging Eng/Vendor Mgmt communicate BuildRight&#x27;s packaging requirements to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/Vendor Mgmt communicate BuildRight&#x27;s packaging requirements to vendors and private-label suppliers: product/transport packaging spec (W3522/W3523), palletization and inbound packaging standard (W3534), barcoding/GTIN (links to VS-29/VS-71), labeling/regulatory (W3527), and sustainability/EPR (W3526); include in vendor onboarding (links to VS-03.1) and PO terms
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Vendor Mgmt / Private Label
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3525_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3525_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3525_Task6" name="Quality/Packaging Eng audit vendor/private-label packaging compliance: incoming…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quality/Packaging Eng audit vendor/private-label packaging compliance: incoming inspection (links to VS-31.1), packaging-spec conformity, damage-in-transit rate (links to W3540/VS-90), barcoding/labeling accuracy, and pallet/inbound compliance (W3534); manage non-compliance and chargeback (links to VS-03/W245)
Responsible (R): Quality / Packaging Eng
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3525_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3525_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3525_Task7" name="Packaging Eng/Private Label manage packaging changes with vendors: spec…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Packaging Eng/Private Label manage packaging changes with vendors: spec updates, transition/last-time-buy (links to W1026), sustainability transitions (W3526), and private-label packaging refresh (links to VS-41); track compliance in the vendor scorecard (links to VS-67/W3512)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Private Label
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3525_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
