    <bpmn:process id="W_W3526" name="W3526. Sustainable Packaging &amp; EPR / Extended Producer Responsibility" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sustainability plan (links to VS-25); EPR Act RA 11898 / LGU plastic rules
Frequency: Program + annual reporting
Volume: Group packaging portfolio
Owner: Packaging Engineering / Sustainability
Participants: Packaging Eng, Sustainability (links to VS-25), Merchandising (links to VS-01/VS-41), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Compliance (links to VS-22), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Waste Mgmt (links to VS-73)
Source: workflow W3526 — Sustainable Packaging &amp; EPR / Extended Producer Responsibility</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3526_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3526_Lane1" name="Packaging Eng">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3526_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3526_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3526_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3526_Lane2" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3526_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3526_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3526_Start4" name="Sustainability plan (links to VS-25); EPR Act RA 11898 / LGU plastic rules">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3526_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3526_Task5" name="Packaging Eng/Sustainability set the sustainable-packaging strategy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/Sustainability set the sustainable-packaging strategy: recyclable/biodegradable material targets, packaging reduction/right-sizing, recycled-content goals, elimination of problematic single-use plastics (links to W3543), and alignment to the ESG/sustainability plan (links to VS-25.3) and EPR obligations (RA 11898)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Sustainability
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3526_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3526_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3526_Task6" name="Packaging Eng execute material transitions: identify SKUs for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Packaging Eng execute material transitions: identify SKUs for recyclable/biodegradable redesign (links to W3522), vendor engagement (W3525), business case and transition plan, and manage trade-offs (cost, performance, shelf-life); coordinate with circular economy (links to VS-73) and recycling/EPR-programs (PRO partnerships)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Procurement / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3526_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3526_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3526_Task7" name="Sustainability/Compliance manage EPR compliance and reporting: packaging-data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability/Compliance manage EPR compliance and reporting: packaging-data collection (material/weight by type), PRO (Producer Responsibility Organization) registration and fees, EPR plan/submission, LGU plastic-ordinance compliance (links to VS-76), and disclosure (links to VS-25.3); audit and report to governance (W3544)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3526_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3526_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3526_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
