    <bpmn:process id="W_W3527" name="W3527. Packaging Labeling, Hazmat &amp; Regulatory Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Packaging spec (W3522); regulatory change (links to VS-22)
Frequency: Per SKU + on change
Volume: All SKUs incl. hazmat (paint, chemicals, solvents)
Owner: Packaging Engineer / Compliance
Participants: Packaging Eng, Compliance/Regulatory (links to VS-22), Quality (links to VS-31), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Import/Customs (links to VS-02.2/VS-87), Legal (links to VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W3527 — Packaging Labeling, Hazmat &amp; Regulatory Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3527_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3527_Lane1" name="Packaging Eng">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3527_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3527_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3527_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3527_Lane2" name="Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3527_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3527_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3527_Start4" name="Packaging spec (W3522); regulatory change (links to VS-22)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3527_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3527_Task5" name="Packaging Eng/Compliance specify required labeling per SKU/category: mandatory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/Compliance specify required labeling per SKU/category: mandatory labels (DTI-BPS/ICC, FDA where applicable, PS Mark links to VS-22/VS-31), product-safety and precautionary labels, country-of-origin, ingredients/chemical (GHS for hazmat links to VS-24.3), and consumer information (Consumer Act RA 7394 links to VS-22)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3527_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3527_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3527_Task6" name="Packaging Eng/Import ensure hazmat and regulated packaging compliance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Packaging Eng/Import ensure hazmat and regulated packaging compliance: UN-certified packaging for dangerous goods (paint, solvents, adhesives links to VS-24.3), hazmat marking/labels/placards, IATA/IMDG/DOT for transport (links to VS-110/W3503 import), and DENR rules (links to VS-73); validate for import (links to VS-87)
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / Import / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3527_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3527_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3527_Task7" name="Quality/Compliance audit labeling/hazmat compliance on incoming and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quality/Compliance audit labeling/hazmat compliance on incoming and private-label (links to VS-31/VS-41), manage non-compliance and recalls (links to VS-89), and maintain the compliance record for audit (links to VS-88/VS-22); track regulatory change (links to VS-22.3)
Responsible (R): Quality / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3527_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3527_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3527_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3527_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-79 (ensure RTI &amp; pallet asset reconciliation.) | - operational: labeling audit; operational: hazmat packaging spec and validation
Owner: Packaging Engineer / Compliance</bpmn:text>
