    <bpmn:process id="W_W3528" name="W3528. Packaging Cost, Bill of Material &amp; Lifecycle Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly analytics cycle; packaging-BOM (W3522)
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Group packaging cost
Owner: Packaging Engineering / FP&amp;A
Participants: Packaging Eng, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), SCM/Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), BI (links to VS-28.1), Merchandising (links to VS-01/VS-101), Master Data (links to VS-29)
Source: workflow W3528 — Packaging Cost, Bill of Material &amp; Lifecycle Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3528_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3528_Lane1" name="Packaging Eng">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3528_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3528_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3528_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3528_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3528_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3528_Start3" name="Monthly analytics cycle; packaging-BOM (W3522)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3528_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3528_Task4" name="Packaging Eng/FP&amp;A capture the packaging-BOM cost per SKU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packaging Eng/FP&amp;A capture the packaging-BOM cost per SKU (unit/inner/master/pallet packaging material cost) in the item/landed cost (links to VS-29/W3515), and compute total packaging cost by category/vendor/channel; identify high-cost and over-packaged SKUs
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / FP&amp;A / BI
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3528_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3528_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3528_Task5" name="Packaging Eng/SCM analyze the packaging cost drivers: material price (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Packaging Eng/SCM analyze the packaging cost drivers: material price (links to VS-106 commodity), volume, spec/sizing, damage (W3540), and sustainability premium (W3526); model right-sizing/standardization savings and trade-offs
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / SCM / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3528_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3528_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3528_Task6" name="Packaging Eng/FP&amp;A publish the packaging-cost and lifecycle analytics to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Packaging Eng/FP&amp;A publish the packaging-cost and lifecycle analytics to executives (links to VS-33.2) and governance (W3544), feed reduction initiatives (W3518) and merchandising decisions (links to VS-01/VS-101), and track packaging cost-as-%-of-COGS over time
Responsible (R): Packaging Eng / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3528_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3528_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3528_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3528_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-562 (ensure controlled execution — Packaging Engineering, Specification &amp; Procurement (PA-111.1).) | - operational: packaging-BOM capture; operational: governance and tracked initiatives
Owner: Packaging Engineering / FP&amp;A</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
